# Generic single-database configuration

Auto-generate:
`
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "create documents table"
`

Apply:
`
alembic upgrade head
`

Rollback:
`
alembic downgrade -1
`

Mark the DB as current without migration:
`
alembic stamp head
`

View status and history:
`
alembic current
alembic heads
alembic history
`
